{"version":1,"content":"<p>烏克蘭重創連接俄羅斯與被佔領克裏米亞半島的克裏米亞大橋。正當基輔自身的基礎設施接連遭到打擊之際，這次襲擊也對普京形成一次象徵性打擊。俄方任命的克裏米亞行政長官謝爾蓋・阿克肖諾夫證實，這座戰略要地大橋在周一短暫關閉之後，夜間再度遭到襲擊。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586798.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:33:58.266829+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T12:18:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:27:13.176094+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T12:27:13.176094+00:00","content_hash":"7b6230d1ac29809c613534c46761403d73949ba2dd01eb932cbb74ce11e877e6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}